      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِعَالٌ</span></b>  <i>A piece of rag with which a cooking-pot
is put down</i> (S, K) <i>from the fire;</i> (S;) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِعَالَةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُعَالَةٌ</span></b> : (K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُعُلٌ</span> (S, TA) and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَعَائِلُ</span>. (TA.) ＝   
